"<div class=\"card panel breit\" role=\"dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"bt\">\n    <div class=\"label\">Beutel · {0} / {1} Gegenstände</div>\n    <h1 id=\"bt\">Ausrüstung</h1>\n    <div class=\"beutel2\">\n      <div class=\"b-links\"><div class=\"slots\">{2}</div><div class=\"held-stats\">{3}</div><span class=\"label\">Seltene Materialien</span>{4}</div>\n      <div class=\"b-mitte\"><div class=\"raster\">{5}</div>\n        <p class=\"note\">{6} <span class=\"eff-punkt inline\"></span> = Sonderwirkung, E = ausgerüstet</p>\n        {7}</div>\n      <div class=\"b-rechts panel\" id=\"itemDetail\"></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"knopfreihe\">\n      <button class=\"btn\" data-a=\"zu\" type=\"button\">Zurück ins Dorf</button>\n      {8}\n    </div>\n  </div>":"<div class=\"card panel breit\" role=\"dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"bt\">\n    <div class=\"label\">背包 · {0} / {1} 件物品</div>\n    <h1 id=\"bt\">装备</h1>\n    <div class=\"beutel2\">\n      <div class=\"b-links\"><div class=\"slots\">{2}</div><div class=\"held-stats\">{3}</div><span class=\"label\">稀有材料</span>{4}</div>\n      <div class=\"b-mitte\"><div class=\"raster\">{5}</div>\n        <p class=\"note\">{6} <span class=\"eff-punkt inline\"></span> = 特殊效果，E = 已装备</p>\n        {7}</div>\n      <div class=\"b-rechts panel\" id=\"itemDetail\"></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"knopfreihe\">\n      <button class=\"btn\" data-a=\"zu\" type=\"button\">返回村子</button>\n      {8}\n    </div>\n  </div>",
"<div class=\"card panel breit\" role=\"dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"bw\">\n    <div class=\"label\">Kaserne · Wen bildest du aus?</div>\n    <h1 id=\"bw\">Ein Begleiter für dich</h1>\n    <p class=\"story\">Ein paar Leute aus dem Dorf melden sich freiwillig. Einer zieht in die Kaserne, begleitet dich auf jede Mission und hilft bei Überfällen. Über die Kaserne bildest du ihn später weiter aus.</p>\n    <div class=\"begleiter-wahl\">{0}</div></div>":"<div class=\"card panel breit\" role=\"dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"bw\">\n    <div class=\"label\">兵营 · 你要训练谁？</div>\n    <h1 id=\"bw\">一位同伴</h1>\n    <p class=\"story\">村里有几个人自告奋勇。其中一人会住进兵营，陪你执行每一次任务，并在袭击时帮忙。之后你可以在兵营继续训练他。</p>\n    <div class=\"begleiter-wahl\">{0}</div></div>",
"<div class=\"card panel breit\" role=\"dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"hd\">\n    <div class=\"label\">Tag {0} · Beziehung: {1}{2}</div>\n    <h1 id=\"hd\">{3}</h1>\n    <p class=\"note\">Du hast {4}. Jeder Handel verbessert eure Beziehung.</p>\n    {5}\n    <div class=\"haendler-liste\">{6}</div>\n    {7}\n    <button class=\"btn\" data-a=\"heim\" type=\"button\">{8}</button>\n  </div>":"<div class=\"card panel breit\" role=\"dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"hd\">\n    <div class=\"label\">第 {0} 天 · 关系：{1}{2}</div>\n    <h1 id=\"hd\">{3}</h1>\n    <p class=\"note\">你有 {4}。每次交易都会改善关系。</p>\n    {5}\n    <div class=\"haendler-liste\">{6}</div>\n    {7}\n    <button class=\"btn\" data-a=\"heim\" type=\"button\">{8}</button>\n  </div>",
"<div class=\"card panel breit\" role=\"dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"hh\"><div class=\"label\">Die Gasse · Ansehen {0}</div>\n    <h1 id=\"hh\">Der Hehler</h1>\n    <p class=\"story\">Ein runder Mann mit Melone und einem Monokel aus Lazi-Glas. „Alles gefunden, nichts gestohlen. Und wenn doch, dann von jemandem, der es nicht mehr braucht.“</p>\n    <span class=\"label\">Heiße Ware (heute)</span>\n    <div class=\"aushaenge\">{1}</div>\n    <p class=\"note\">{2}</p>\n    <span class=\"label\">Er kauft deine Beute</span>\n    <div class=\"aushaenge\">{3}</div>\n    <button class=\"btn\" data-a=\"zurueck\" type=\"button\">Zurück auf den Platz</button></div>":"<div class=\"card panel breit\" role=\"dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"hh\"><div class=\"label\">小巷 · 声望 {0}</div>\n    <h1 id=\"hh\">销赃人</h1>\n    <p class=\"story\">一个戴圆顶礼帽、戴拉兹玻璃单片眼镜的胖男人。“全是捡来的，没有偷的。就算是偷的，也是从用不着它的人那里偷的。”</p>\n    <span class=\"label\">黑货（今天）</span>\n    <div class=\"aushaenge\">{1}</div>\n    <p class=\"note\">{2}</p>\n    <span class=\"label\">他收购你的战利品</span>\n    <div class=\"aushaenge\">{3}</div>\n    <button class=\"btn\" data-a=\"zurueck\" type=\"button\">回到广场</button></div>",
"<div class=\"card panel breit\" role=\"dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"ht\">\n    <div class=\"label\">{0} · {1}</div>\n    <h1 id=\"ht\">Stufe {2}</h1>\n    <div class=\"bar xp\"><i style=\"width:{3}%\"></i><b>{4} / {5} Erfahrung</b></div>\n    <div class=\"held-grid\">\n      <div class=\"held-werte\">\n        <span class=\"label\">{6}</span>\n        {7}\n        <dl class=\"facts\">\n          <dt>Leben</dt><dd>{8}</dd>\n          <dt>Schaden</dt><dd>{9} %</dd>\n          <dt>Angriffe</dt><dd>{10} % Tempo</dd>\n        </dl>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"held-baum\"><span class=\"label\">Fähigkeiten · eine pro Meilenstein, die Wahl ist endgültig</span>{11}</div>\n    </div>\n    <button class=\"btn\" data-a=\"zu\" type=\"button\">Zurück ins Dorf</button>\n  </div>":"<div class=\"card panel breit\" role=\"dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"ht\">\n    <div class=\"label\">{0} · {1}</div>\n    <h1 id=\"ht\">等级 {2}</h1>\n    <div class=\"bar xp\"><i style=\"width:{3}%\"></i><b>{4} / {5} 经验</b></div>\n    <div class=\"held-grid\">\n      <div class=\"held-werte\">\n        <span class=\"label\">{6}</span>\n        {7}\n        <dl class=\"facts\">\n          <dt>生命</dt><dd>{8}</dd>\n          <dt>伤害</dt><dd>{9} %</dd>\n          <dt>攻击</dt><dd>{10} % 速度</dd>\n        </dl>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"held-baum\"><span class=\"label\">能力 · 每个里程碑选一项，选择后不可更改</span>{11}</div>\n    </div>\n    <button class=\"btn\" data-a=\"zu\" type=\"button\">返回村子</button>\n  </div>",
